      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 27, 2018 22:30:09 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "<br/>I'm going to try and post more this year. Doubled my sarracenia greenhouse space, so have a house of just flava! Hold on to your seats this year...<br/><br/>Waccamaw flowers<br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/A6E8C6D6-08C2-41AF-8BEB-78E828E5C3FE.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>Waccamaw selfing<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/51672D9A-2C6A-4A78-81FE-C707CAD80799-e1524671152299.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A different waccamaw selfing<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/5FDEC06A-F4FC-447E-8BF9-EE80A232FC4A.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A nice libertry county rubricorpora<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/402D25CD-10B7-4BB3-82CA-FF9592D1C255-e1524671127722.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>Improved black veins from <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-116 group-0\" href=\"/user/116\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@philcula\"><span itemprop=\"name\">philcula</span></a></span> <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/CBB7BE38-125A-4601-86F7-A1D8EF550CDD.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A whole bunch of flavas with pure carolina genetics <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/0AE8B479-4176-4490-926D-70B56EC3CF28.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A nice red leuco from <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-11 group-15\" href=\"/user/11\" itemprop=\"url\" style=\"color: #136616;\" title=\"@meizzwang\"><span itemprop=\"name\">meizzwang</span></a></span> <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/A2DD93FA-D23