      "body_html": "<div author=\"@almightydolla\" class=\"quote\" source=\"/post/37003/thread\" timestamp=\"1524886209\"><div class=\"quote_body\"><div class=\"quote_avatar_container\"><div class=\"avatar-wrapper avatar_size_quote avatar-177\" title=\"almightydolla\"><img alt=\"almightydolla Avatar\" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/DB71737A-6034-4962-BD33-E0EE4E771801-e1557159096911.jpeg\"/></div></div><div class=\"quote_header\"><a href=\"/post/37003/thread\"><abbr class=\"o-timestamp time\" data-timestamp=\"1524886209000\" title=\"Apr 27, 2018 22:30:09 GMT -5\">Apr 27, 2018 22:30:09 GMT -5</abbr></a> <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-177 group-0\" href=\"/user/177\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@almightydolla\"><span itemprop=\"name\">almightydolla</span></a></span> said:</div><br/>I'm going to try and post more this year. Doubled my sarracenia greenhouse space, so have a house of just flava! Hold on to your seats this year...<br/><br/>Waccamaw flowers<br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/A6E8C6D6-08C2-41AF-8BEB-78E828E5C3FE.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>Waccamaw selfing<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/51672D9A-2C6A-4A78-81FE-C707CAD80799-e1524671152299.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A different waccamaw selfing<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/5FDEC06A-F4FC-447E-8BF9-EE80A232FC4A.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A nice libertry county rubricorpora<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/402D25CD-10B7-4BB3-82CA-FF9592D1C255-e1524671127722.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>Improved black veins from <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-116 group-0\" href=\"/user/116\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@philcula\"><span itemprop=\"name\">philcula</span></a></span> <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/CBB7BE38-125A-4601-86F7-A1D8EF550CDD.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A whole bunch of flavas with pure carolina genetics <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/0AE8B479-4176-4490-926D-70B56EC3CF28.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/>A nice red leuco from <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-11 group-15\" href=\"/user/11\" itemprop=\"url\" style=\"color: #136616;\" title=\"@meizzwang\"><span itemprop=\"name\">meizzwang</span></a></span> <br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/A2DD93FA-D23D-48F9-AF0D-2FDB6AA21554-e1524885724194.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><div class=\"quote_clear\"></div></div></div>Bring them on, I can't wait for you to share more of those gems of yours.   <br/>",
      "body_text": "Apr 27, 2018 22:30:09 GMT -5\nalmightydolla\nsaid:\nI'm going to try and post more this year. Doubled my sarracenia greenhouse space, so have a house of just flava! Hold on to your seats this year...\nWaccamaw flowers\nWaccamaw selfing\nA different waccamaw selfing\nA nice libertry county rubricorpora\nImproved black veins from\nphilcula\nA whole bunch of flavas with pure carolina genetics\nA nice red leuco from\nmeizzwang\nBring them on, I can't wait for you to share more of those gems of yours.",
