      "author_username": "almightydolla",
      "author_user_id": 177,
      "timestamp_iso": "2018-04-29T18:47:09+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1525027629000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 29, 2018 13:47:09 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "<br/>Check out this <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-11 group-15\" href=\"/user/11\" itemprop=\"url\" style=\"color: #136616;\" title=\"@meizzwang\"><span itemprop=\"name\">meizzwang</span></a></span>    rubricorpora 'Best' X Waccamaw seedling. Best of both worlds?<br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/3DA66348-7AAD-4056-9011-B020E2E26EE2-e1525026999775.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:40%;\"/> <img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/FAF2C8C2-297B-4936-A6E9-A14B419F63A2-e1525027106363.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:40%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Mixing it up, here's the flowers on this leuco 'green' leaving all that anthrocyanin in the dust...<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/06D8820A-E1FF-433C-9655-6DDA004B9993-e1525027062824.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>And a choice seedling of <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-11 group-15\" href=\"/user/11\" itemprop=\"url\" style=\"color: #136616;\" title=\"@meizzwang\"><span itemprop=\"name\">meizzwang</span></a></span>   cuprea 'Best Clone' X Waccamaw that i'm crushing hard on right now<br/><img alt=\" \" src=\"http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/4E74A5B1-18E7-4EC8-A769-6938790D8A6E-e1525027041218.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:50%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>",
      "body_text": "Check out this\nmeizzwang\nrubricorpora 'Best' X Waccamaw seedling. Best of both worlds?\nMixing it up, here's the flowers on this leuco 'green' leaving all that anthrocyanin in the dust...\nAnd a choice seedling of\nmeizzwang\ncuprea 'Best Clone' X Waccamaw that i'm crushing hard on right now",
      "image_urls": [
        "http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/3DA66348-7AAD-4056-9011-B020E2E26EE2-e1525026999775.jpeg",
        "http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/FAF2C8C2-297B-4936-A6E9-A14B419F63A2-e1525027106363.jpeg",
        "http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/06D8820A-E1FF-433C-9655-6DDA004B9993-e1525027062824.jpeg",
        "http://www.stevescrazyplants.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/4E74A5B1-18E7-4EC8-A769-6938790D8A6E-e1525027041218.jpeg"
